  "description": "The high-performance, 100% offline financial validation toolkit for .NET.\n\n\t  Key Features:\n\t  - IBAN Validation: Specific rules for Belgium, Netherlands, France, Germany, UK, and Luxembourg (plus generic ISO 13616).\n\t  - Payment Cards: Zero-allocation Luhn algorithm check, brand detection (Visa, MC, Amex), and secure formatting.\n\t  - Payment References: Generate and Validate Belgian OGM/VCS and International ISO 11649 (RF).\n\t  - Corporate Identity: Foundation for VAT and Enterprise number validation.\n\t  - Structure: BIC/SWIFT format validation (ISO 9362).\n\n\t  Designed for FinTechs and SaaS: Zero dependencies, zero network latency, and privacy-first (no external API calls).",
